{
  "name": "tunescout",
  "display_name": "TuneScout",
  "description": "TuneScout 是本地音乐库管理与自动化工具，堪称 Navidrome 的最佳伴侣：支持多平台音乐下载、元数据刮削、曲库自动整理，并可订阅网易云/QQ 音乐歌单与榜单，自动生成 m3u8 播放列表同步到 Navidrome。",
  "category": "music",
  "tags": [
    "音乐",
    "歌单",
    "下载",
    "刮削",
    "Navidrome"
  ],
  "website": "https://hub.docker.com/r/yuwancumian2009/tunescout-v2",
  "architectures": [
    "amd64",
    "arm64"
  ],
  "image": "yuwancumian2009/tunescout-v2",
  "default_ports": [
    {
      "port": 8503,
      "protocol": "tcp",
      "description": "Web 管理界面"
    }
  ],
  "config_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
      "ports",
      "volumes",
      "tunescout_env"
    ],
    "containers": [
      {
        "name": "tunescout",
        "title": "TuneScout",
        "settings": [
          {
            "type": "ports",
            "title": "端口设置",
            "fields": [
              "ports"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "volumes",
            "title": "存储空间设置",
            "fields": [
              "volumes"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "env",
            "title": "环境变量",
            "fields": [
              "tunescout_env"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "advanced",
            "title": "高级设置",
            "fields": [
              "privileged"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "description": "歌单下载刮削与 Navidrome 同步工具"
      }
    ],
    "properties": {
      "ports": {
        "type": "array",
        "title": "端口设置",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "local_port",
            "container_port",
            "protocol"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "protocol": {
              "enum": [
                "tcp",
                "udp"
              ],
              "type": "string",
              "title": "协议",
              "default": "tcp"
            },
            "local_port": {
              "type": "integer",
              "title": "本地端口",
              "maximum": 65535,
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "container_port": {
              "type": "integer",
              "title": "容器端口",
              "maximum": 65535,
              "minimum": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "default": [
          {
            "protocol": "tcp",
            "local_port": 8503,
            "container_port": 8503
          }
        ]
      },
      "volumes": {
        "type": "array",
        "title": "存储空间设置",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "host_path",
            "container_path",
            "mode"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "mode": {
              "enum": [
                "rw",
                "ro"
              ],
              "type": "string",
              "title": "权限",
              "default": "rw"
            },
            "host_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "本地路径",
              "format": "directory"
            },
            "container_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "容器路径"
            }
          }
        },
        "default": [
          {
            "mode": "rw",
            "host_path": "tunescout/config",
            "container_path": "/app/config"
          },
          {
            "mode": "rw",
            "host_path": "tunescout/library_cache.db",
            "container_path": "/app/library_cache.db"
          },
          {
            "mode": "rw",
            "host_path": "tunescout/music",
            "container_path": "/music"
          },
          {
            "mode": "rw",
            "host_path": "tunescout/download",
            "container_path": "/download"
          },
          {
            "mode": "rw",
            "host_path": "tunescout/playlists",
            "container_path": "/playlists"
          }
        ]
      },
      "privileged": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "title": "特权模式",
        "default": false,
        "description": "以特权模式运行容器，可访问宿主机全部设备，一般无需开启"
      },
      "tunescout_env": {
        "type": "array",
        "title": "环境变量",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "key",
            "value"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "key": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "变量名"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "值"
            }
          }
        },
        "default": [
          {
            "key": "TZ",
            "value": "Asia/Shanghai"
          },
          {
            "key": "WEB_USERNAME",
            "value": "admin"
          },
          {
            "key": "WEB_PASSWORD",
            "value": "admin1234"
          },
          {
            "key": "PUID",
            "value": "1000"
          },
          {
            "key": "PGID",
            "value": "1000"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "yaml_template": "services:\n  tunescout:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n{%- for item in tunescout_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n",
  "readme": "# TuneScout\n\nTuneScout 是一体化的本地音乐库管理与自动化工具，是 Navidrome 服务器的最佳伴侣：多源音乐下载、智能元数据刮削、自动整理曲库，并可一键订阅网易云/QQ 音乐歌单与排行榜，自动生成 m3u8 播放列表，完美适配 Navidrome。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. **重要**：`/app/library_cache.db` 是数据库文件挂载，首次部署前请先在宿主机对应路径手动创建一个**空文件**（如 `touch tunescout/library_cache.db`），否则 Docker 会把它创建成目录导致启动失败。\n2. 将 `/music` 的本地路径改为你的音乐库目录（与 Navidrome 的音乐库一致），`/playlists` 改为 Navidrome 能扫描到的播放列表目录。\n3. 「环境变量」中 `WEB_USERNAME` / `WEB_PASSWORD` 为 Web 登录账号密码（设置后自动开启认证），部署后请及时修改默认密码。\n\n## 使用\n\n部署完成后访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:8503`，在系统设置中配置下载源顺序与音乐平台 Cookie，然后即可搜索下载、订阅歌单并定时同步。",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "compose",
  "changelog": "初始导入",
  "backup_paths": [
    "/app/config"
  ],
  "is_builtin": false
}
